Purpose:
Reserved module for future string-oriented helpers.

Current status:
This file intentionally exports no functions yet. Use the builtins directly:
- append
- index
- remove
- len
- to_string

Examples:
"ab" "cd" append print
"\n" print
"hello" 1 index print
"\n" print
"hello" 1 remove print
"\n" print
99 to_string print
*]
